    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda orjeeda Yeroboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha ghamnyaan Abiya was orjeeda Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yeroboamu gatmoadaanyi, “Ng'eada ak giyami geaw, ea meanala gideaba guwoosi gatmooda Yeroboamu, ak guwi ng'eanyiida Shilo; ng'ula gwanda hoowa Ahiyaheeda was sibaneeda, ghayi rugu gideaba aniini gaydoaw sugoocheanda jea goombal fiisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aadana geadi mukaataji damanamughuush, ea maandaasajeesu ng'ay, ea gidageeta maleeda, ak guweesi niny; ak gaygwarukuneey gichea gwahisa baleanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasindunu gatmooda Yeroboamu; ghang'eat ak gawa Shilo, ghwahita gheeh Ahiya. Nea Ahiya ea mudu ghoang'wearda gheanyangaaschi, ning'oowiidi aba gwearguumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Ahiya, “Ng'ula, gatmooda Yeroboamu gayghoan goobearseey ng'asheega orjeedaanyi; aba gideaba ghamnyaan. Ak girukusi ng'asheanji ea ng'asheanji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu gwasin geaw gatmu nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Ahiya geeshanga siida, damanda sikna gidaghuuta, hean gwayeesha, “Beeni gah, gatmooda Yeroboamu; ghwasaan anda gisin geaw sih nuut? Aba gideaba aniini siicheakseani headaang'u geandeawi ng'asheega durumani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Una rukusiina Yeroboamu, ‘Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli: “Aba gideaba naaghaambiicheey aba jeeda buuneeda, ak ghaanung' huwa sugoocheanda jea ghoahaaghwa fugeasu was Israeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geageandeawi gheambalmeeda gheeh Dawdi ak geagoonyeey; ak ang'iing'i ea muwuurjeewani siideanyu bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi, ang'waanya diigheanyeekeasu, nea gweadu geeshteanyu aba gurooroadaanyi sean, nea gwasina gida doabiiw aba madeeda gheanyangeasu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghamneawa ang'iing'i ea nisini riing'eeda ea ghwanaawa gea fuga ghayi asheedeaweey, ak ea nuwi sisiina geaw aseecheeka suuk, ea aseecheeka sisna geatinga, ak ginung' danyareas, ak gijaksean bwadaw; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi ng'ula, gaydeadu ng'asheega munyas jeeda gheeda Yeroboamu, ak gaydahuuyda headiga sean bea Yeroboamu, gea mida ghealooniga ea gea abal geat aba Israeli, ak gaydahuta gheeh Yeroboamu, gawuurji siida ghwarda sururuuda ea goosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilinyoo gaba gheeh Yeroboamu iimeewsa jeeda mujiineeda haw gayghwaak gudajeega; nea gilinyoo gameewsa ng'eanyiida bwara gayghwaak madoonyaka humng'eeda; aba gideaba ng'asheanji gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.”’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'eada, ak gibiiksi gheang'u, inyas gilaabi jeeda mujiineeda haw, gayghami baleanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygooyeawda buuneesean bea Israeli aba badaydaanyi, ak gabuy; aba gideaba niny siida Yeroboamu was siichea eebuy, aba gideaba headaanyi gwanda ng'asheanda ahoosan NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA Israeli, aba jeeda gheeda Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwaloosa geaw NG'UTAMIIDA sugoocheanda jea goombal Israeli, was siichea gahuuyda gheeda Yeroboamu askweareani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gicha NG'UTAMIIDA gayghabwar fuga Israeli, gawuurji gidayuukiida muudayga beega, ak gayghahoana fuga Israeli jeeda ng'eanyiini miyiin ghayi adaw ghweaniga nyaawaan, ak goodearsa giigheawda eenda Furati, aba gideaba nisissa geat aseecheeka nyaawa siguura Asherimu, anyareas NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaygooruutu fuga Israeli aba ng'asheega riing'eeda Yeroboamu, ghayi sin ea gea nung' gwasin fuga Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat gatmooda Yeroboamu, ak gawa ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Dirsa. Hean nea ghwahita bugusta gheeda, ghami baleanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabuy fuga sean bea Israeli nea gooyeawusa, gawuurji ginyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ghayi rukuna ghuuta siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda Ahiyaheeda was sibaneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Yeroboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gadiyoojiga siipuut sin Yeroboamu gida ng'ucheata ea gida ambaliischeata, ng'ula sing'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea damanda ambaliischeewa Yeroboamu gweanyeeka ea diktam ea iyeenya; ak gwaluudayi ghweanigaaschi, ak goombaliischi orjeedaanyi was Nadabu ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda was Rehoboamu bea Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Rehoboamu was orjeeda Sulemani goombaliischi aba Yuda. Nea Rehoboamu abeeda gaba gweanyeew haradam ea agi damanda ang'eada gheambalmeeda, hean goombaliischi gweanyeew ispwa aba Yerusalemu, mujiineeda haw ghayi loat NG'UTAMIIDA aba bugusta eemoojiga Israeli, ghamiinda gheawungaaschi aba hoowa. Gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Naama bea eemeeda Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gamunyasiidi fuga Yuda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ghang'uda shidoodeaba ghaang' aba giidiinyeanyeeka sin, ea gaburdeawa gea ghayi sin ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba eara saawa gwadeeksa geat heeda siikghaambiit, ea daranajeega, ea aseecheeka siguura Asherimu aba uhuumba gilinyoo ea giijeeda gil, ea guumsheaka geediga nyawiiri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwanda headiga hiseada aba ng'eanyiida. Gwasin gawuurji munyasnacheeka eemoojiga aruuteawa NG'UTAMIIDA madeeda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba muut bea sugoocheanda was Rehoboamu, ghwahidu Shishakeeda was sugoocheanda Misri Yerusalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gageanda haleanjeeda siitiiwsa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea haleanjeeda gheeda sugoocheanda; ak gageanda haleanjeeda sean. Ak gageanda igeambooniga sean bea lagheanga dahaabu ghayi sin Sulemani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwasin sugoocheanda was Rehoboamu igeambooniga lagheanga oomng'i, ak ghwayiin geatinga fuga hees bea shirikara, fura ghuuta gheeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iissa Iinyo gawa sugoocheanda jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, inyeesa ghwaat furiischoodiga ak ghoadealda jeeda gheeda furiischoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gadiyoojiga siipuut bea Rehoboamu ea gilinyoo gwasin, meeng'oorsiina jeeda gitaabooda Damanyoojiga sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda ng'ucheeda dageascheeda Rehoboamu ea Yeroboamu galeaga sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwaluudayi Rehoboamu ghweanigaaschi ak geebuy sea ghweanigaaschi aba jeeda mujiineeda haw bea Dawdi. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Naama bea eemeeda Amoni. Ak Abiyaheeda was orjeedaanyi goombaliischi aba hoorgeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
